<title>BRAZIL: Brazil exports total $845 mln November 11-14.</title>
<headline>Brazil exports total $845 mln November 11-14.</headline>
<dateline>BRASILIA 1996-11-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian exports reached $845 million in the period November 11-14, said a spokesman at the Industry and Commerce Ministry.</p>
<p>Average daily exports were $211.3 million during last week's four working days, the spokesman said. Friday was a national holiday.</p>
<p>In the first two weeks of November, exports totalled $2.041 billion, with a daily average of $204.1 million, the ministry said.</p>
<p>-- Julio Villaverde, Brasilia Newsroom 5561 223 0358</p>
